<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0a0d13">
  <title>Circle Games · Space Battle Pong</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/home.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="masthead">
    <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Circle Games home"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span> CIRCLE GAMES</a>
    <span class="masthead-note">Bring your friends. Pick a side.</span>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="game-title">
      <div class="game-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> SHARED SCREEN MULTIPLAYER</p>
        <h1 id="game-title">Space<br>Battle <span>Pong.</span></h1>
        <p class="intro">Your phone is your controller.<br>Your friends are your competition.</p>
        <p class="description">Dodge incoming fire, level up your ship, and lead your team to victory. One arena, two teams, and a battle that gets bigger with every upgrade.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="/space-battle">Host a match <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="button secondary" href="/space-battle/controller">Join with phone</a>
        </div>
        <a class="desktop-link" href="/space-battle/pc">Playing on a computer? Join with WASD <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <div class="game-tags"><span>2 teams</span><span>3 game modes</span><span>Bot opponents</span></div>
      </div>
      <figure class="arena-preview">
        <div class="preview-bar"><span>THE ARENA</span><span>BLUE <b>VS</b> RED</span></div>
        <img src="/images/game1/arena-v2.webp" alt="Spaceships exchanging cyan and pink projectiles across the nebula arena" width="1536" height="864">
        <figcaption><span class="live-dot"></span> Auto fire. Keep moving. Make every upgrade count.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>
    <section class="how-to" aria-label="How to play">
      <article><span class="step">01</span><div><h2>Open the arena</h2><p>Host a match on a shared screen. Choose a mode and add bots if you need teammates.</p></div></article>
      <article><span class="step">02</span><div><h2>Get everyone in</h2><p>Scan the arena's QR code on your phone. Pick a name and join your team.</p></div></article>
      <article><span class="step">03</span><div><h2>Move. Dodge. Upgrade.</h2><p>Use the joystick or WASD to move. Your ship fires automatically. Spend points as you level up.</p></div></article>
    </section>
    <section class="experiments" aria-label="More games">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">IN THE WORKSHOP</p><h2>More experiments on the horizon.</h2></div>
      <nav aria-label="Game prototypes"><a href="/game2">Game 2 <span>Prototype ↗</span></a><a href="/game3">Game 3 <span>Prototype ↗</span></a><a href="/game4">Game 4 <span>Prototype ↗</span></a></nav>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer><span>CIRCLE GAMES / SPACE BATTLE PONG</span><span>Built for playing together.</span></footer>
</body>
</html>
